{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "PanduArah API Integrasi",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "API untuk sistem klien (SIMRS, sistem akademik, HR) yang mengubah data lokasi dan penutupan.\n\nAutentikasi: header `Authorization: Bearer <kunci>` (kunci dibuat Super Admin di Admin → Integrasi).\nSetiap kunci punya izin per modul dan bisa dibatasi ke venue tertentu. Batas 120 permintaan per menit per kunci.\n\nPerubahan lokasi, kategori, status, dan jam masuk ke draft dan tampil di Visitor setelah publish dari Admin.\nPenutupan berlaku langsung tanpa publish.\n\nDeep link Visitor: `{URL Visitor}/v/{venueId}?loc={locationId}` membuka lokasi; parameter lain:\n`b` (gedung), `f` (lantai), `from`/`to` (id lokasi atau `lng,lat,floorId`), `o` (kode QR titik asal),\n`a11y=1` (rute aksesibel), `lang=id|en`, `ev` (id event). Setiap lokasi di API membawa `visitorPath`."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "/functions/v1/api"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "apiKey": []
    }
  ],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "apiKey": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "Kunci API `pa_…`."
      }
    },
    "responses": {
      "Error": {
        "description": "Galat: 400/422 isian salah, 401 kunci tidak berlaku, 403 izin kurang, 404 tidak ada, 409 bentrok, 429 terlalu banyak permintaan.",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "message": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "errors": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "Location": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "code": {
            "type": ["string", "null"]
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["active", "coming_soon", "inactive_temporary", "inactive_permanent"]
          },
          "openingDate": {
            "type": ["string", "null"],
            "format": "date"
          },
          "categories": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "units": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "hours": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "weekly": {
                "type": "object",
                "description": "Jam per hari (Senin = mon). Bila dikirim, seluruh jam mingguan diganti; hari yang tidak disebut berarti tutup.",
                "properties": {
                  "mon": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^\\d{2}:\\d{2}-\\d{2}:\\d{2}$",
                      "example": "08:00-16:00"
                    }
                  },
                  "tue": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^\\d{2}:\\d{2}-\\d{2}:\\d{2}$",
                      "example": "08:00-16:00"
                    }
                  },
                  "wed": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^\\d{2}:\\d{2}-\\d{2}:\\d{2}$",
                      "example": "08:00-16:00"
                    }
                  },
                  "thu": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^\\d{2}:\\d{2}-\\d{2}:\\d{2}$",
                      "example": "08:00-16:00"
                    }
                  },
                  "fri": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^\\d{2}:\\d{2}-\\d{2}:\\d{2}$",
                      "example": "08:00-16:00"
                    }
                  },
                  "sat": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^\\d{2}:\\d{2}-\\d{2}:\\d{2}$",
                      "example": "08:00-16:00"
                    }
                  },
                  "sun": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^\\d{2}:\\d{2}-\\d{2}:\\d{2}$",
                      "example": "08:00-16:00"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "special": {
                "type": "array",
                "description": "Tanggal khusus (libur, jam pendek). Bila dikirim, seluruh tanggal khusus diganti; spans kosong = tutup.",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["date"],
                  "properties": {
                    "date": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "format": "date"
                    },
                    "spans": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "pattern": "^\\d{2}:\\d{2}-\\d{2}:\\d{2}$",
                        "example": "08:00-16:00"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "visitorPath": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "/v/{venueId}?loc={locationId}"
          },
          "updatedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        }
      },
      "LocationUpsert": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["code"],
        "description": "Lokasi dicocokkan dengan kode (tanpa membedakan huruf besar). Kolom yang tidak dikirim tidak diubah. Lokasi baru wajib name dan type.",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 32
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 120
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Nama tipe lokasi yang sudah ada."
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["active", "coming_soon", "inactive_temporary", "inactive_permanent"]
          },
          "openingDate": {
            "type": ["string", "null"],
            "format": "date",
            "description": "Wajib untuk coming_soon."
          },
          "categories": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Nama kategori milik tipe lokasinya; daftar ini mengganti kategori lama."
          },
          "hours": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "weekly": {
                "type": "object",
                "description": "Jam per hari (Senin = mon). Bila dikirim, seluruh jam mingguan diganti; hari yang tidak disebut berarti tutup.",
                "properties": {
                  "mon": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^\\d{2}:\\d{2}-\\d{2}:\\d{2}$",
                      "example": "08:00-16:00"
                    }
                  },
                  "tue": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^\\d{2}:\\d{2}-\\d{2}:\\d{2}$",
                      "example": "08:00-16:00"
                    }
                  },
                  "wed": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^\\d{2}:\\d{2}-\\d{2}:\\d{2}$",
                      "example": "08:00-16:00"
                    }
                  },
                  "thu": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^\\d{2}:\\d{2}-\\d{2}:\\d{2}$",
                      "example": "08:00-16:00"
                    }
                  },
                  "fri": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^\\d{2}:\\d{2}-\\d{2}:\\d{2}$",
                      "example": "08:00-16:00"
                    }
                  },
                  "sat": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^\\d{2}:\\d{2}-\\d{2}:\\d{2}$",
                      "example": "08:00-16:00"
                    }
                  },
                  "sun": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^\\d{2}:\\d{2}-\\d{2}:\\d{2}$",
                      "example": "08:00-16:00"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "special": {
                "type": "array",
                "description": "Tanggal khusus (libur, jam pendek). Bila dikirim, seluruh tanggal khusus diganti; spans kosong = tutup.",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["date"],
                  "properties": {
                    "date": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "format": "date"
                    },
                    "spans": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "pattern": "^\\d{2}:\\d{2}-\\d{2}:\\d{2}$",
                        "example": "08:00-16:00"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Closure": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "reason": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "startsAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "endsAt": {
            "type": ["string", "null"],
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "target": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["unit", "path", "connector"]
          },
          "unitCode": {
            "type": ["string", "null"]
          },
          "locationCodes": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "paths": {
    "/v1/openapi.json": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Dokumen ini",
        "security": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OpenAPI 3.1"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/venues": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Venue yang bisa dijangkau kunci ini",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Daftar venue",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "venues": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "id": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "format": "uuid"
                          },
                          "name": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "timezone": {
                            "type": "string"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/venues/{venueId}/locations": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Lokasi venue (izin locations:read)",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "venueId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            },
            "description": "Id venue (lihat `GET /v1/venues`)."
          },
          {
            "name": "code",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Satu kode lokasi."
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Lokasi beserta kategori, unit, dan jam",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "locations": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Location"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          }
        }
      },
      "put": {
        "summary": "Upsert massal berdasarkan kode lokasi (izin locations:write)",
        "description": "Maks. 1000 lokasi. Semua baris diterapkan atau tidak sama sekali. Hasil per baris: created, updated, atau unchanged.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "venueId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            },
            "description": "Id venue (lihat `GET /v1/venues`)."
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["locations"],
                "properties": {
                  "locations": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "maxItems": 1000,
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LocationUpsert"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "example": {
                "locations": [
                  {
                    "code": "POLI-01",
                    "status": "active",
                    "hours": {
                      "weekly": {
                        "mon": ["08:00-12:00", "13:00-16:00"],
                        "tue": ["08:00-16:00"],
                        "wed": ["08:00-16:00"],
                        "thu": ["08:00-16:00"],
                        "fri": ["08:00-11:30"]
                      },
                      "special": [
                        {
                          "date": "2026-12-25",
                          "spans": []
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Hasil per lokasi",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "locations": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "code": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "id": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "format": "uuid"
                          },
                          "action": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": ["created", "updated", "unchanged"]
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "422": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/venues/{venueId}/categories": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Tipe lokasi dan kategorinya (izin locations:read)",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "venueId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            },
            "description": "Id venue (lihat `GET /v1/venues`)."
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Tipe dan kategori"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/venues/{venueId}/closures": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Penutupan yang berjalan dan terjadwal (izin closures:read)",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "venueId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            },
            "description": "Id venue (lihat `GET /v1/venues`)."
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Penutupan",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "closures": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Closure"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "summary": "Tutup lokasi (semua unitnya) atau satu unit (izin closures:write)",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "venueId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            },
            "description": "Id venue (lihat `GET /v1/venues`)."
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["reason"],
                "properties": {
                  "locationCode": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "unitCode": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "reason": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "maxLength": 200
                  },
                  "startsAt": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "date-time",
                    "description": "Bawaan: sekarang."
                  },
                  "endsAt": {
                    "type": ["string", "null"],
                    "format": "date-time"
                  }
                }
              },
              "example": {
                "locationCode": "RAD-01",
                "reason": "Perawatan alat",
                "endsAt": "2026-12-01T15:00:00+07:00"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Penutupan yang dibuat (satu per unit)"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "422": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/venues/{venueId}/closures/{closureId}": {
      "delete": {
        "summary": "Akhiri penutupan sekarang; yang belum mulai dibatalkan (izin closures:write)",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "venueId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            },
            "description": "Id venue (lihat `GET /v1/venues`)."
          },
          {
            "name": "closureId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Diakhiri"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "409": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "webhooks": {
    "event": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Peristiwa webhook",
        "description": "Dikirim ke alamat yang didaftarkan Super Admin. Header Standard Webhooks:\n`webhook-id`, `webhook-timestamp` (detik), `webhook-signature` = `v1,` + base64(HMAC-SHA256(\nkunci = base64-decode(rahasia tanpa `whsec_`), isi = `{id}.{timestamp}.{body}`)).\nBalas 2xx dalam 10 detik. Selain itu dicoba ulang setelah 1 menit, 5 menit, 30 menit, 2 jam, dan 6 jam.\nJenis: publish.completed, publish.rollback, closure.created, closure.updated, closure.deleted,\nlocation.changed (perubahan dalam satu transaksi digabung), ping.",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "uuid"
                  },
                  "type": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "createdAt": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "date-time"
                  },
                  "venueId": {
                    "type": ["string", "null"],
                    "format": "uuid"
                  },
                  "data": {
                    "type": "object"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Diterima"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
